ris ~1.5-2 hr day-trip); Big Sky PBR bull-riding week in July; Ikon/lift prices dynamic"],"safety":{"emergency":"911 (police/fire/medical/rescue dispatch); alert ski patrol on-mountain","hospital":"Big Sky Medical Center (Bozeman Health) in Big Sky - 24/7 ER (operator/level/address blocked - verify); larger facilities in Bozeman (~1 hr)","malaria":"none","yellow_fever":"not required","activity_note":"ALTITUDE (base ~7,400-7,500 ft, Lone Peak 11,166 ft GENUINELY HIGH; tram tops 11,000 - hydrate, ease alcohol, descend if AMS worsens); AVALANCHE backcountry - Gallatin National Forest Avalanche Center (GNFAC, mtavalanche.com), Southern Madison / Gallatin zone - VERIFY exact zone (page 403); beacon/probe/shovel + guide, never duck ropes; STEEP/EXTREME Lone Peak couloirs + no-fall zones off the tram (respect closures); US-191 Gallatin Canyon winter driving + WILDLIFE on road; tree-wells; cold + intense UV"},"timing":{"peak":"High winter (Christmas/NY, MLK, Presidents'' Week, Jan-Feb powder) + big summer peak (July: Yellowstone + Big Sky PBR week)","shoulder":"early Dec (pre-holiday) + April spring skiing","green":"late spring (May) + fall (Oct-Nov) between the winter + Yellowstone seasons","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Presidents'' + Montage/Lone Mountain Ranch 3-6 mo (holidays longer); July Yellowstone/PBR far ahead; luxury earliest","off_season_specials":"April spring skiing; whole summer Yellowstone season + PBR; midweek value; Lone Mountain Ranch Nordic","event_peaks":"Christmas/NY, MLK + Presidents'', spring break; summer Big Sky PBR (July 16-18, 2026 - verify) + Yellowstone traffic","campaign_start":"FIRE spring early-bird (Apr-Jun) Ikon renewals + summer-Yellowstone/PBR pre-book; fire winter again Sep-Nov"},"jewels":[{"name":"Ski one of the biggest mountains in America","si_tag":"Winter/Ski","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"window dynamic; package best value","timing":"ski Nov-Apr","draw_rank":1,"hook":"5,850 acres of largely uncrowded terrain across