ur heritage (not current elite-training)"],"safety":{"emergency":"911 (police/fire/medical/rescue dispatch); alert ski patrol on-mountain; Summit County Rescue Group + Flight for Life air evac","hospital":"St. Anthony Summit Hospital, Frisco (~9 mi) - Level III trauma, Flight for Life base; backcountry casualties airlifted","malaria":"none","yellow_fever":"not required","activity_note":"ALTITUDE (base ~9,600 ft, summit 12,998 ft - AMS real; acclimatize, hydrate, ease alcohol, descend if worsening, HAPE/HACE call 911); AVALANCHE backcountry/sidecountry - CAIC ''Vail & Summit County'' zone daily bulletin (by ~4:30 PM), beacon/probe/shovel + guide, never duck ropes; tree-wells/deep-snow suffocation; cold + intense UV; I-70 winter driving + Colorado Traction Law (Sept 1-May 31, Dotsero-Morrison), escalates to Chain Law - check CDOT cotrip.org"},"timing":{"peak":"High winter (Christmas/NY, MLK, Presidents'', Feb-Mar) ski + Ullr Fest + Snow Sculpture (Jan) + spring break (Mar); Jul-Aug summer","shoulder":"early season (early Nov-mid Dec), Jan midweek, April spring skiing, Sep-early Oct","green":"May + late Oct-early Nov (mud months - resort closed/winding down, lowest rates)","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Presidents'' + ski-in/out condos 4-8 mo; Feb-Mar 3-6 mo; summer 2-4 mo; shoulder/April 2-6 wk; Epic Pass by early fall","off_season_specials":"April spring-skiing + festival packages; May/Nov value; summer hiking + alpine coaster + Breck Epic; Historic District year-round hook","event_peaks":"Ullr Fest (mid-winter), International Snow Sculpture Championships (late Jan), Christmas/NY, MLK + Presidents'', spring break, closing (Apr-May), Fourth of July, Breck Epic (Aug) - verify exact dates","campaign_start":"FIRE spring early-bird (Apr-Jun) for pass-holders + peak weeks; fire again Sep-Nov fall wave; summer town/festivals by Feb-Mar"},"jewels":[{"name":"The Imperial Express SuperChair + Peak 8 high-alpine bowls","si_tag":"Winter/Ski","status":"live","tier":"comfort","pri