, 24/7 ER (details 403''d - verify)","malaria":"none","yellow_fever":"not required","activity_note":"ALTITUDE (base 6,255 ft, summit 10,067 ft - summit tops 10,000; hydrate, ease alcohol [note the casinos], descend if AMS worsens); AVALANCHE backcountry - Sierra Avalanche Center (SAC), Central Sierra Nevada (Yuba Pass to Ebbetts Pass incl greater Tahoe basin + Carson Range above Heavenly) - VERIFY exact sub-zone; beacon/probe/shovel + guide, never duck ropes; tree-wells + Sierra-cement deep snow; cold + intense UV off snow/lake; US-50 over Echo Summit (7,382 ft) winter driving + Caltrans chain control (NDOT on the NV side)"},"timing":{"peak":"High winter (Christmas/NY, MLK, Presidents'' Week, Feb-Mar) + a second SUMMER peak (Jul-Aug lake season); Stateline swells in both","shoulder":"late Apr-May (post-ski/pre-summer) + Sep-Oct (post-summer/pre-ski)","green":"late-spring + late-fall lulls between the two peaks","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Presidents'' + casino-resort peak 3-6 mo (holidays longer); regular winter 2-4 mo; Epic by early fall","off_season_specials":"spring skiing + full summer lake season (beaches/boating/hiking) + casino nightlife year-round + midweek value","event_peaks":"Christmas/NY, MLK + Presidents'', spring break; summer lakefront concerts + casino showroom acts (verify)","campaign_start":"FIRE spring early-bird (Apr-Jun) Epic renewals + summer-lake pre-book; fire winter again Sep-Nov"},"jewels":[{"name":"Ski across two states in a day","si_tag":"Winter/Ski","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"window dynamic; package best value","timing":"ski Nov-Apr","draw_rank":1,"hook":"Heavenly''s terrain crosses the California–Nevada line — lap a California bowl and a Nevada face on one pass","si":"ski","blurb":"Heavenly''s terrain crosses the California–Nevada line — lap a California bowl and a Nevada face on one pass","when":"ski Nov-Apr","commission":"DMC/ski-op 10-15% (embedded-capable)"},{"name":"Ride the gondola up over the lake","si_tag"