"name":"A quiet dinner in Mammoth Lakes","si_tag":"Romance & Honeymoons","status":"future","tier":"premier","price_band":"~USD 50-120/pp","timing":"year-round; reserve","draw_rank":3,"hook":"an intimate fine-dining table in a real town — no manufactured resort plaza","si":"romance","blurb":"an intimate fine-dining table in a real town — no manufactured resort plaza","when":"year-round; reserve","commission":"venue/bundle"}],"faq":null,"seo":{"meta_title":"Mammoth Mountain Ski Guide: California''s Highest Resort & Longest Season","meta_description":"Plan Mammoth Mountain, California - the state''s highest ski resort (an 11,053-ft volcano on the Ikon Pass), with ~400 inches of snow, one of the longest seasons in the US (often into July), genuine Eastern Sierra hot springs, and the US-395 drive from LA - with real timing, altitude/avalanche/volcanic safety and booking intel.","slug":"mammoth-california","primary_keyword":"Mammoth Mountain California travel guide","long_tail":["highest ski resort in California Mammoth","Mammoth Mountain Ikon Pass","Mammoth late-season spring skiing","hot springs near Mammoth Lakes","how to get to Mammoth from Los Angeles","Mammoth Yosemite Airport flights"],"search_language":"es-US","local_keywords":["guia de esqui Mammoth Mountain California","estacion de esqui mas alta de California","esqui de primavera Mammoth","aguas termales cerca de Mammoth Lakes","como llegar a Mammoth desde Los Angeles","pase Ikon Mammoth"],"hreflang":["en","es-US"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","content_freshness":"2026-07-18"},"booking":{"bin":"freely_bookable","level":"L1-equivalent (domestic US — no state.gov self-advisory)","codes":[],"advisory_verified":"2026-07-18","consent_flow":false,"note":"US domestic, lowest-risk tier; real risk is environmental (high altitude + avalanche + volcanic CO2 at Horseshoe Lake + US-395 winter driving / Tioga Pass winter closure), not security"},"s